{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandatory ID Cards and Purchase Limits for Scratch Cards",
        "additional_details": "Every year, thousands of people struggle with gambling addiction, and scratch cards are often seen as a harmless entry point.\r\nWe want to:\r\n- reduce excessive gambling and protect vulnerable adults and young people\r\n- make it harder for people to buy unlimited quantities\r\n- encourage responsible gambling while allowing adults to purchase scratch cards in moderation.\r\n\r\nJust as ID is required for many age-restricted products, a properly age-monitored system could we believe promote safer gambling and reduce financial harm, while maintaining access for those who gamble responsibly. ",
        "background": "We call on the UK Government to introduce mandatory ID verification and a daily limit of 5 scratch cards per individual to reduce gambling-related harm and promote responsible play.",
